This repository contains material from two sources.

1. Original material created for VerifyThisBench, released under the MIT
   License (see LICENSE): the evaluation scripts (scripts/), Docker
   environments (envs/), prompts (prompts/), the per-task decomposition and
   per-tool prompts in VerifyThisBenchDS/, the seed tests in
   VerifyThisBenchTest/, the relaxed templates' TODO structure in
   VerifyThisBenchXS/, and the dataset JSON files.

2. Third-party material from the VerifyThis competition series
   (https://www.pm.inf.ethz.ch/research/verifythis.html), 2011-2024:
   - the natural-language challenge descriptions in VerifyThisBenchDS/ and
     VerifyThisBenchXS/;
   - the human-written reference solutions (solution.* files) in
     VerifyThisBenchXS/, and the code they contain that is reused in the
     partial templates.
